Protocol Description	Inducible SpCas9 expressing cells were seeded for 1000x representation per sgRNA, and infected at a multiplicity of infection (MOI) of 0.3, to avoid multiple sgRNA infections per cell, using the previously published and validated genome-wide human lentiviral library (Kosuke Yusa Human GW CRISPR guide RNA library V1). After puromycin selection (1 µg/mL), cells were exposed to doxycycline for 3 days and harvested at day 0 (T0) and on day 14 (T1).	Genomic DNA was extracted from the T=0 and T=1 samples using DNeasy Blood and Tissue Kit (Qiagen) as per manufacturers instructions.  	sgRNA sequence were amplified with Q5 polymerase (NEB) with the following primers Forward 5’- ACACTCTTTCCCTACACGACGCTCTTCCGATCTCTTGTGGAAAGGACGAAACA and Reverse 5’- TCGGCATTCCTGCTGAACCGCTCTTCCGATCTCTAAAGCGCATGCTCCAGAC. 	The PCR products sequenced on HiSeq2500.
Protocol Hardware				Illumina HiSeq 2500
